      "name": "Keto Cheesy Bacon Bread Recipe",
      "description": "The orange crust gives you the first clue as to how delicious this bread is. Tucked inside this almond-flour based loaf is plenty of crispy bacon and cheddar cheese.\n\nMake sure you heed the warning about slicing the bread while it’s hot. Like many keto goods, this one’s fragile until completely cooled. If you try to slice it early, then you may end up with a mess on your hands.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n7 ounces bacon\n1 1/2 cups almond flour\n1 tablespoon baking powder\n1/3 cup sour cream\n2 large eggs\n4 tablespoons butter, melted\n1 cup shredded cheddar cheese\n\nNutrition Summary:\nThis makes a total of 10 servings of Keto Cheesy Bacon Bread. Each serving comes out to be 306.63 Calories, 26.25g Fats, 2.99g Net Carbs, and 14.44g Protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 30 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
